    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis derelict house sits on approximately 0.7 of an acre, less than 750 metres from the heart of Charlestown, with shops, schools and local amenities all within easy reach.\n\nThe property is in need of significant renovation, but comes with great potential, offering a spacious site on the edge of Charlestown, within easy access of both the N17 and N5. \n\nThere may also be potential to avail of the Derelict Homes Grant, with funding of up to 70,000 potentially available, subject to the relevant criteria and approval.\n\nWater, electricity and sewage mains are all adjacent. \n\nTo see current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit SherryFitz.ie and register for your mySherryFitz account."
      },
